            BUS_FACTORY["BusFactory<br/>create_local() -> IBus<br/>create_for_testing() -> IBus<br/>Transparent V1/V2 switch:<br/>try: k1_bus_core.RustBus<br/>except: LocalBus (V1 fallback)"]:::py_factory
